    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">A voice announcement and a phone announcement are two names for the same service - a voice artist's message recorded for a phone system or IVR. Some companies say "voice announcement", others "phone announcement" or "IVR message"; the scope, file formats and prices are identical. You'll find the rates in the <a href="#pricing-ivr" class="text-accent hover:underline">IVR pricing</a> section - from EUR 90 net.</p>
