      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Phone greetings &amp; IVR announcements</h2>
      <p>Effective communication requires rapid response to changing competitive and regulatory environments. For example, GDPR regulations forced companies that process personal data to update their IVR systems with appropriate data-processing announcements. In situations like these, we help by offering fast delivery of multilingual phone messages.</p>
