    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Phone announcements build a positive company image</h3>
      <p>Phone greetings serve as both a branding and communication element. When prepared carefully, they encourage clients to engage. Conversely, poorly made recordings can turn away first-time callers. A professional greeting is your company's audio business card.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Key statistics</h3>
