    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Background music for your announcement (Music on Hold) costs EUR 30 net - we pick a track licensed for playback in your phone system. A caller waiting in silence hangs up after about 30 seconds; with background music, after 2-3 minutes. Music on Hold is a real factor in keeping callers on the line.</p>
